<p>Now the number that decides it for most households: <strong>a BareEarth 2-pack is $174.98 — two blankets for less than one Bearaby.</strong> One for the bed and one for the couch. One for you and one for the partner who keeps stealing yours — because they will, and every owner thread confirms it: <em>"So nice I ordered a second the moment I used this one."</em> The 4-pack drops it to $62.48 a blanket, which is Christmas for a family of anxious sleepers sorted in one order.</p>

